{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Vajjiputta (1st)","html":"<article id='thag1.62'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.62 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.62 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Sattamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Seven </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Vajjiputtattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Vajjiputta (1st) </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Ekakā mayaṁ araññe viharāma, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>We dwell alone in the wilderness, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Apaviddhaṁva vanasmiṁ dārukaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>like a log dumped in a forest. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Tassa me bahukā pihayanti, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Lots of people are jealous of me, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Nerayikā viya saggagāminan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>as beings in hell are of one going to heaven. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Vajjiputto thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
